  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued support to Burma&#x2019;s participation in Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Continued support to Burma&#x2019;s participation in Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative is a component of Improving the management of public funds for the benefit of people in Myanmar reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;2,943,705. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration, Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
